and all our wave picture.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.750
And why we have
to look at a wave?

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:10.410
And this is important if
I deal with the interface.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:14.190
Because as I mentioned
before, ideal interface

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.800
