00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.670
Blackbody radiation.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:33.270
When this displacement or, say,
wavelength times temperature

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:37.470
is about 3,000 micron Kelvin,
so at room temperature,

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.000
that's 10 micron.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:43.320
It's a very large distance,
10 microns, compared

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:46.350
