Plane wave i omega t minus
kx plus B e minus i omega t

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.540
plus kx.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:31.757
I have two solutions.

00:13:31.757 --> 00:13:33.340
That's what's we
read and done before.

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.230
Now you can tell me,
the first solution

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:43.070
